    "feminine": "Step two: waist. {{CHILD_NAME}} steps forward and the water rises, cool and quiet, and her jaw goes tight without her deciding to make it tight. She can still see the bottom. She can still feel it. But there is more water now than before, and her hands find the surface and press down against it, like they need something to push on."
  },
  {
    "pageNumber": 7,
    "masculine": "Step three is chest-deep. {{CHILD_NAME}} takes the step and the water comes up and up and stops at his chest, and right then his shoulders go up toward his ears and his stomach hurts the way it hurts before something scary. His hands find Khaled's hands and hold on — not pulled there, just there, needing something real. The floor is still under his feet. But it feels far away now. Far enough that {{CHILD_NAME}} thinks: this is where I go under and don't come back up.",
    "feminine": "Step three is chest-deep. {{CHILD_NAME}} takes the step and the water comes up and up and stops at her chest, and right then her shoulders go up toward her ears and her stomach hurts the way it hurts before something scary. Her hands find Khaled's hands and hold on — not pulled there, just there, needing something real. The floor is still under her feet. But it feels far away now. Far enough that {{CHILD_NAME}} thinks: this is where I go under and don't come back up."
