    "masculine": "Step four: chin. {{CHILD_NAME}} takes the step and the water comes right up to his chin, cool against his skin, and his stomach clenches tight. But he counts again — \"One, two, three\" — and notices: the bottom is still there under his feet. The worst thing has not happened. Not at knees. Not at waist. Not at chest. Not here. The water is just water.",
