    "masculine": "Khaled says, quietly: \"One more. Float. I'll be right here. You count.\" {{CHILD_NAME}}'s stomach drops all the way down. This is the one he was most afraid of — feet leaving the floor, nothing underneath, nothing to push on. His whole body goes stiff. His fists curl. And then he leans back anyway, and his feet lift, and he says: \"One.\"",
    "feminine": "Khaled says, quietly: \"One more. Float. I'll be right here. You count.\" {{CHILD_NAME}}'s stomach drops all the way down. This is the one she was most afraid of — feet leaving the floor, nothing underneath, nothing to push on. Her whole body goes stiff. Her fists curl. And then she leans back anyway, and her feet lift, and she says: \"One.\""
